---
{
  title: "ghostp"
}
---
### NAME

    ghostp() - Returns 1 if the object is a ghost, 0 if not.

### SYNOPSIS

    int ghostp( object ob );

### DESCRIPTION

    Returns 1 if the object is a ghost, 0 if not.

### PARAMETERS

    ob  (STD_GHOST)
        The object to check.

### RETURN VALUES

    (ob is STD_GHOST) 1 if the object is a ghost, otherwise 0.
